# Combined topology: one worker runs request-builder, flame-builder, and
# job-router together. ORDER MATTERS: job-router (included last) wires
# firehose:consumer -> job-router directly; the connect_node below re-routes
# it through firehose:tee so both request-builder and job-router feed from
# the tee. jobs:sieve (Age_Sieve) sits downstream of job-router, unaffected.

include request-builder
include flame-builder
include job-router
make_node Tee firehose:tee
disconnect_node firehose:consumer
connect_node firehose:consumer firehose:tee
connect_node firehose:tee request-builder
connect_node firehose:tee job-router
